OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with light rain for most
OL,6,Fareas through the morning. Rain easing
OL,7,Fthrough the early afternoon with cloud
OL,8,Flifting and beginning to break by late
OL,9,Fafternoon. Temperatures near average
OL,10,Fwith light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with cloud breaking
OL,13,Fthrough the evening and clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping widely away from the north
OL,15,FPennines. Winds strengthening
OL,16,Fovernight with a colder night in
OL,17,Fprospect.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
