OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly partly cloudy and
OL,6,Fdry, although the odd shower can't be
OL,7,Fruled out. Moderate winds across the
OL,8,Fregion with temperatures a touch
OL,9,Fwarmer than Friday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAfter a
OL,12,Ffine, if breezy, morning, rain moves
OL,13,Fthrough Sunday afternoon. A pleasant
OL,14,Fday on Monday before an increasingly
OL,15,Fwet and windy day on Tuesday.
OL,16,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
